   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Coffman conditions (all 4 needed):\n1 mutual exclusion\n2 hold and wait\n3 no preemption\n4 circular wait\n\nBreak one: e.g. lock in a\nglobal order (lower id first).",
